{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19882","headline":"偷诗 · 孟郊","name":"偷诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饿犬齚枯骨，自吃馋饥涎。\n今文与古文，各各称可怜。\n亦如婴儿食，饧桃口旋旋。\n唯有一点味，岂见逃景延。\n绳床独坐翁，默览有所传。\n终当罢文字，别着逍遥篇。\n从来文字净，君子不以贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}